Description: automatic sit/stand companion for the IKEA Idasen desk
 Idasen Companion automatically alternates an IKEA Idasen desk between
 sitting and standing positions based on active time at the computer. It
 ships a background daemon (systemd user service, D-Bus API, journald
 logging) and a Qt 6 GUI with a system tray icon, live status, manual
 controls, presets, scheduling, statistics and desktop notifications. Works
 on GNOME and KDE Plasma, on both X11 and Wayland.

