Description: Qt-free sit/stand companion for the IKEA Idasen desk
 Idasen Companion automatically alternates an IKEA Idasen desk between
 sitting and standing positions based on active time at the computer. This
 standalone headless package ships the systemd user daemon, D-Bus API,
 journald integration and command-line client without Qt, PySide6, desktop
 files, icons or AppStream metadata.
